### partial_eq_wrapper_arc_eq

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl partial_eq_wrapper_arc_eq forall t.\n    (self : rust.ref (rust.partial_eq_wrapper (arc t)))\n    (other : rust.ref (rust.partial_eq_wrapper (arc t)))\n    =\n    self\n    |> rust.unwrap_0_ref\n    |> arc_ptr_eq (\n        other\n        |> rust.unwrap_0_ref\n    )","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl partial_eq_wrapper_arc_eq forall t.
      (self : rust.ref (rust.partial_eq_wrapper (arc t)))
      (other : rust.ref (rust.partial_eq_wrapper (arc t)))
      =
      self
      |> rust.unwrap_0_ref
      |> arc_ptr_eq (
          other
          |> rust.unwrap_0_ref
      )
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

